ation"},{"text":"Problem-solving"},{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Team management"},{"text":"Stakeholder coordination"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Experience"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hospital internship"},{"text":"Exposure to at least 3–4 administrative departments"},{"text":"One hospital-operations project"},{"text":"One healthcare analytics dashboard"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest long-term pathway is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Hospital Executive","Healthcare Operations","Hospital Management","Data-Driven Healthcare Leadership"]},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, the student should not position themselves as only an administrator. The stronger 2030+ profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Healthcare Operations","Quality","Finance","Analytics","Digital Health."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"That combination can create pathways into hospital operations, healthcare consulting, health-tech operations, quality management and eventually senior healthcare-management roles."}]}]}